{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35236","headline":"咏柳二首 一 · 顾云","name":"咏柳二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"带露含烟处处垂，绽黄摇绿嫩参差。\n长堤未见风飘絮，广陌初怜日映丝。\n斜傍画筵偷舞态，低临粧阁学愁眉。\n离亭不放到春暮，折尽拂檐千万枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}